| Action | Endpoint |
|---|---|
| info / branches / commits / changes | `/api/git/repo/info`, `/branches`, `/branch/commits`, `/changes` **(exists)** |
| fetch / pull / push | `POST /api/git/repo/fetch`, `/pull`, `/push` **(to add)** |
| create branch | `POST /api/git/repo/branch` `{branch, from_branch}` **(to add)** |
| delete branch | `DELETE /api/git/repo/branch?branch=` **(to add)** |
| checkout | `POST /api/git/repo/branch/checkout` `{branch}` **(to add)** |
| commit all | `POST /api/git/repo/commit` `{message, stage_all}` **(to add)** |
| merge | `POST /api/git/repo/merge` `{from_branch, to_branch, message}` **(to add)** |

