## Verification notes

- **Range selection** — `selectRange` slices `groupFiles(group)` between the anchor and the clicked row, so ranges never leak across `Staged` / `Changes`. The anchor is set by plain and ctrl clicks, kept untouched by shift+clicks (so repeated shift+click extends/contracts from the same origin), and dropped by `clearSelection`, `pruneSelection` (anchor file left the tree) and every bulk operation.
- **Checkbox** — switched to `@click.stop.prevent` + `onCheckboxClick` so the DOM checkbox is never toggled by the browser without a matching state change (prevents desync on shift+click ranges, where the row is not toggled but included in the range).
- **Diff icon** — always visible per row (`fa-code-compare`), accented when that file is the open diff; the stage/rollback actions stay hover-only so the row does not get crowded. Row tooltip now documents click / shift+click.

